/* =============================================================================
   CLAIMS LEDGER — WoWForever
   One row per factual statement the site makes. `status` mirrors the evidence
   class of the source(s) it rests on:
     official  = Blizzard first-party statement
     press     = developer interview / named-outlet reporting
     datamine  = extracted from the beta client, may change
     guide     = reputable guide site's analysis (attributed, never stated as fact)
     community = unverified; shown only with an explicit warning
     ours      = our own reasoning from verified facts; labelled as analysis
     unknown   = explicitly "not announced"; recorded so the gap is visible
   `snapshot` is the date the claim was last checked against its source.
   ========================================================================== */
